  m_text: 'Thank you for playing our game! Here are some known bugs the team is working
    hard on fixing:


    1) Please DONT use the mic toggle in the settings. Instead,
    just set the player volume to 0.

    2) Respawn sometimes doesn''t properly
    fix player rotation.

    3) Radiation full screen effect does not work for clients
    (You will be killed though).

    And any other minor bugs and glitches.


    If
    you have any other feedback apart from this, please check out our Itch.io page!'
